 * Parsed the way Pi parses it — the first token after the slash — and answered
 * from Pi's own list rather than guessed from the shape of the text, so a
 * question that merely starts with a slash is still a question.
 *
 * >>> namesCommand([{ name: "compact", description: "", source: "prompt" }], "/compact now")
